% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/nis2_implementing_regulation_significant_incidents. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% If parameters-sources.yaml is the COMMISSIONING REGISTER (its first line
% says so), then for EACH of its keys:
%   1. the VALUE is a fact in the determination slice that READS it
%      (that slice's .clausal file), never here;
%   2. this file holds its provenance record, a fact:
%        parameter_source(<key>, [label-'...', ref-'...', verbatim-'...']).
%      with the verbatim pair OMITTED while the yaml entry is
%      `status: unverified`.
% Otherwise this file holds no records at the baseline.
%
% This domain has no commissioning register: parameters-sources.yaml is the
% empty template. The statutory figures of Implementing Regulation (EU)
% 2024/2690 (EUR 500 000 and 5 percent in Art 3(1)(a); the 30-minute,
% 20-minute and one-hour limits; the user thresholds of Arts 7 and 9 to 14;
% the domain-name thresholds of Art 5(c)) are fixed by the act itself, not
% transposition knobs. They are declared once with :- constant_value/2 in the
% slice nis2_implementing_regulation_significant_incidents.clausal and traced
% through the implements(Key) markers to the citation/2 records in
% citations.clausal.
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

:- end_module(parameters).
